1a:["$","h2",null,{"children":"Compare the terms side by side"}]
1b:["$","p","Use this table to identify questions for the award owner. It describes common patterns, not definitions that override a named programme.",{"children":"Use this table to identify questions for the award owner. It describes common patterns, not definitions that override a named programme."}]
1c:[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Scholarship and fellowship: a practical comparison","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Scholarship and fellowship: a practical comparison"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Question",{"scope":"col","children":"Question"}],["$","th","Scholarship: common pattern",{"scope":"col","children":"Scholarship: common pattern"}],["$","th","Fellowship: common pattern",{"scope":"col","children":"Fellowship: common pattern"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Main purpose"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Support for a course or qualification"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Research, advanced study or professional activity"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Eligible stage"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Depends on the course and fund"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Depends on academic or professional stage"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Selection"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Merit, financial need or programme criteria"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Often project, research or professional merit"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","3",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Support"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"May include fees, living support or both"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"May include stipend, project funds, training or other support"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","4",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Commitment"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Study progress and award conditions"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"May include a project, residency, outputs or programme activities"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","5",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Authority"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"The specific call and award letter"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"The specific call and award letter"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"]
1d:["$","section","2-Match the opportunity to your stage",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Match the opportunity to your stage"}],[["$","p","An undergraduate searching for tuition support should not assume a postdoctoral fellowship is an alternative. Equally, a professional development fellowship may be open to someone who is not enrolled in a degree. Look for the required qualification, completion date, employment stage and experience.",{"children":"An undergraduate searching for tuition support should not assume a postdoctoral fellowship is an alternative. Equally, a professional development fellowship may be open to someone who is not enrolled in a degree. Look for the required qualification, completion date, employment stage and experience."}],["$","p","Make a short eligibility record before drafting: what you have, what the programme requires and what remains unknown. If the wording is unclear, ask a precise question rather than replacing it with an optimistic interpretation.",{"children":"Make a short eligibility record before drafting: what you have, what the programme requires and what remains unknown. If the wording is unclear, ask a precise question rather than replacing it with an optimistic interpretation."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
1e:["$","section","3-Scenario one: a student choosing fee support",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Scenario one: a student choosing fee support"}],[["$","p","Fictional example: Lina has an offer for a taught master’s course and needs help with fees and living costs. A university scholarship offers a fee reduction, while a professional fellowship requires several years of experience and does not fund her degree.",{"children":"Fictional example: Lina has an offer for a taught master’s course and needs help with fees and living costs. A university scholarship offers a fee reduction, while a professional fellowship requires several years of experience and does not fund her degree."}],["$","p","The scholarship is closer to her immediate purpose, but it may still leave a large funding gap. Her next step is to compare remaining fees, living costs and payment dates. The existence of an award does not make the degree affordable unless the whole budget works.",{"children":"The scholarship is closer to her immediate purpose, but it may still leave a large funding gap. Her next step is to compare remaining fees, living costs and payment dates. The existence of an award does not make the degree affordable unless the whole budget works."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
1f:["$","section","4-Scenario two: a graduate preparing a research project",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Scenario two: a graduate preparing a research project"}],[["$","p","Fictional example: Ahmed wants to investigate a focused research question with an academic host. He finds a fellowship that supports a defined research period, but it requires a host invitation and does not pay tuition for a full degree.",{"children":"Fictional example: Ahmed wants to investigate a focused research question with an academic host. He finds a fellowship that supports a defined research period, but it requires a host invitation and does not pay tuition for a full degree."}],["$","p","He should first confirm the project and host conditions, then compare the duration, research expenses and personal support. If his real objective is a PhD, he also needs a degree-admission and multi-year funding plan. A short research stay is not automatically a funded doctoral place.",{"children":"He should first confirm the project and host conditions, then compare the duration, research expenses and personal support. If his real objective is a PhD, he also needs a degree-admission and multi-year funding plan. A short research stay is not automatically a funded doctoral place."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
20:["$","section","5-Scenario three: a professional considering a fellowship",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Scenario three: a professional considering a fellowship"}],[["$","p","Fictional example: Rosa has relevant work experience and is considering a leadership fellowship with residential sessions and a project. The programme may be a strong professional fit, but she must check employer permission, time away, travel, income and the required outputs.",{"children":"Fictional example: Rosa has relevant work experience and is considering a leadership fellowship with residential sessions and a project. The programme may be a strong professional fit, but she must check employer permission, time away, travel, income and the required outputs."}],["$","p","A grant may support participation without replacing a salary. Before accepting, she should understand attendance obligations and any return-home, reporting or continuation conditions. These are practical commitments, not small print to leave until after selection.",{"children":"A grant may support participation without replacing a salary. Before accepting, she should understand attendance obligations and any return-home, reporting or continuation conditions. These are practical commitments, not small print to leave until after selection."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
21:["$","section","6-A stipend is not the same as a complete budget",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-7","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"A stipend is not the same as a complete budget"}],[["$","p","For either label, list fees, accommodation, food, travel, insurance, research costs and dependants separately. Mark each confirmed, conditional, excluded or unknown. Then add the timing: money paid after arrival may not cover a deposit due before departure.",{"children":"For either label, list fees, accommodation, food, travel, insurance, research costs and dependants separately. Mark each confirmed, conditional, excluded or unknown. Then add the timing: money paid after arrival may not cover a deposit due before departure."}],["$","p","Tax, immigration and employment treatment depend on the arrangement and jurisdiction. A generic comparison cannot decide those questions. Use the funder and competent authority for your situation.",{"children":"Tax, immigration and employment treatment depend on the arrangement and jurisdiction. A generic comparison cannot decide those questions. Use the funder and competent authority for your situation."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","$L26",null,{"id":"guides/fellowship-vs-scholarship:section-7","title":"Check your progress","items":["Identify the purpose and exact duration of the award.","Check required degree, experience, nationality and residence.","Separate guaranteed support from discretionary funding.","Calculate costs and cash needed before the first payment.","Read the attendance, progress, reporting and other obligations.","Confirm the formal application route and acceptance conditions."]}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]
22:["$","section","7-Prepare evidence for the actual selection task",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Prepare evidence for the actual selection task"}],[["$","p","For study funding, you may need to show course fit and academic readiness. A research fellowship may require a project, host and feasible method. A professional fellowship may ask for evidence of contribution and a plan to use the experience. Follow the real prompt rather than using one generic motivation letter.",{"children":"For study funding, you may need to show course fit and academic readiness. A research fellowship may require a project, host and feasible method. A professional fellowship may ask for evidence of contribution and a plan to use the experience. Follow the real prompt rather than using one generic motivation letter."}],["$","p","Build a document tracker with who supplies each item and when it must arrive. Strong evidence is specific, consistent and relevant; extra pages do not compensate for an unanswered question. Use the hubs below to find a route, then return to the programme owner for the final rules.",{"children":"Build a document tracker with who supplies each item and when it must arrive. Strong evidence is specific, consistent and relevant; extra pages do not compensate for an unanswered question. Use the hubs below to find a route, then return to the programme owner for the final rules."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Prepare evidence for the actual selection task","children":[["$","$L4","/fellowships/",{"href":"/fellowships/","children":["Compare fellowship opportunities",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$6:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/scholarships/",{"href":"/scholarships/","children":["Explore scholarships",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$6:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/scholarships/phd/",{"href":"/scholarships/phd/","children":["Find research funding",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$6:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
23:["$","section",null,{"className":"source-section","aria-labelledby":"official-sources","children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"official-sources","children":"Official sources and verification"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Source records support the guide. Page update dates describe editorial changes; they do not mean every linked rule was checked again today. Reopen the current call for your programme and intake."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"source-grid","children":[["$","$L4","https://grad.gatech.edu/faq/knowledgebase.php?article=105",{"href":"https://grad.gatech.edu/faq/knowledgebase.php?article=105","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Georgia Tech Graduate Education: fellowship and scholarship distinction"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"An institutional explanation; terminology and award conditions differ across programmes."}]]}],["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"M15 3h6v6","key":"1q9fwt"}],["path",{"d":"M10 14 21 3","key":"gplh6r"}],["path",{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6","key":"a6xqqp"}]],"className":"lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
